## 4. OPENING SEQUENCE

When the player opens the application, display a dark screen.

Show the following text in stages:

BOOT SEQUENCE INITIATED

LOCAL TIME: 03:17:08

NETWORK STATUS: UNKNOWN

LAST HUMAN SIGNAL: 6 DAYS AGO

